# ...except this one: it is a delivered artifact whose sha256 is pinned in the
# package manifest next to it, and the tests compare the rebuilt database
# against it. Ignoring it made the tests pass locally (the file was on disk)
# and fail in CI, where a clean checkout has no untracked files at all.
!deliverables/心域智链_通用训练资料包_20261102/training-reference.sqlite3
